    "statementHTML": "<div class=\"statement-body\">\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-goal\">\n   <h2><span class=\"icon icon-goal\">&nbsp;</span><span>Goal </span></h2>\n   <span class=\"question-statement\">An undercover intelligence operative intercepted an image consisting of <var>N</var> grayscale pixels.<br><br>A secret text message has been concealed inside the image using <strong>Least Significant Bit (LSB) steganography</strong>.<br><br>### Rules<br>1. Each <var>pixel</var> is an 8-bit integer between <const>0</const> and <const>255</const>.<br>2. The least significant bit (LSB) of each pixel (<pre style=\"font-family: monospace\">pixel % 2</pre> or <pre style=\"font-family: monospace\">pixel &amp; 1</pre>) stores one bit of the secret message.<br>3. Every <const>8</const> consecutive bits form the 8-bit binary representation of an ASCII character, ordered from **most significant bit (MSB)** to **least significant bit (LSB)**.<br>4. Extract all characters in order and print the resulting decoded message string.</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-protocol\">\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-input\">Line 1: An integer <var>N</var> for the total number of pixels. <var>N</var> is always a multiple of <const>8</const>.<br>Next <var>N</var> lines: An integer <var>pixel</var> for each pixel intensity value.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-output\">A single line containing the decoded secret message string.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Constraints</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-constraints\">8 &le; <var>N</var> &le; 4000<br><var>N</var> is a multiple of 8<br>0 &le; <var>pixel</var> &le; 255<br>All characters in the hidden message are printable ASCII characters.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Example</div>\n      <div class=\"statement-inout\">\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-in\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-in\">16\n100\n107\n114\n122\n129\n136\n142\n150\n156\n163\n171\n178\n185\n192\n198\n105</pre>\n         </div>\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-out\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-out\">Hi</pre>\n         </div>\n      </div>\n   </div>\n</div>"
